Before we begin, please run the following code chunk in your R console to install and load the packages we’ll use in today’s lecture. This code will only install packages you don’t already have.


Code
if (!requireNamespace("pacman", quietly = TRUE)) {
  install.packages("pacman", quiet = TRUE)
}

pacman::p_load("dagitty", "ggplot2")

